   "q": "What does alarm C-2087 mean on the HX-900, and what does the replacement part cost?",
   "answerable": true,
   "secs": 113.9,
   "error": null,
   "answer": "1. What does alarm C-2087 mean on the HX-900: Alarm C-2087 means a way cover jam. The procedure states to stop the axes, remove chips from the cover lip, and replace the cover wiper strip (part HX9-4471) if the cover is torn. If the electrical cabinet shows wear above 50 %, replace the switch before the next shift.\n2. what does the replacement part cost: 2,350 INR",
